    "show_share": true,
    "description": "GlobalSurgBox, a portable surgical simulator designed for surgical trainees worldwide, was highlighted in a recent paper co-authored by Michael Kirsch. Following a successful workshop organized by the GlobalSurgBox team at CIME, Nairobi, it became evident that reaching out to individuals and fostering collaboration in simulation-based learning is invaluable.",
